# "ночи" reads on the am half of the 12-hour clock ("два часа ночи" is 02:00).
# Over an explicit 24-hour clock it keeps 18:00-23:59 as written ("23:30
# ночи"). No dictionary entry found pins this either way: Wiktionary gives
# ночь as "часть суток между вечером и утром (примерно от полночи до 6
# часов)" (https://ru.wiktionary.org/wiki/ночь), which names no clock hour
# with "ночи".
# 13:00-17:59 is the день (Unicode CLDR Day Period Rules, locale ru,
# afternoon1 [12:00, 18:00)), so "15:30 ночи" names no time.
ночи
